  <item>
    <title>19 Live，Life，东京联络簿 ｜ 【嘉宾：药】</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/6958aaa42db086f897647e9c</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">6958aaa42db086f897647e9c</guid>
    <pubDate>Sat, 03 Jan 2026 05:54:34 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>这是一本来自东京的好朋友间的联络簿。算是体内回归「18：Live，Life，今宵多珍重 ｜ 【嘉宾：药】」的续集。聊了我们这一年又看了什么音乐现场，和想看的音乐人。之后也会有有的没得一箩筐吧。你也可以打开一听啤酒，和朋友聊聊看。平实又好玩。</span></p><span></span><p><span>本期更像是好朋友之间打电话一样的随性聊天。当然是没聊完。但，干杯。至福。</span></p><span></span><p><span>🕙 时间轴：</span></p><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="600">10:00</a></span></strong><span> &nbsp;pit inn性价绝佳的爵士马拉松</span></li><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1200">20:00</a> 浅野忠信儿子也来演爵士了？</span></li><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1800">30:00</a> 致敬山下洋辅燃烧的钢琴？2026年了还是会想念一下Yellow Dance… 星野源也得想念《泰安洋行》，细野晴臣也得想念叮砰巷</span></li><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2400">40:00</a> 是谁看了细野晴臣呀？</span></li><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3000">50:00</a> 角铜真实的音乐场景，satori，声厂</span></li><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3600">60:00</a> 细野小孙孙的小绍介</span></li><span>  </span><li><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4200">01:10:00</a></span></strong><span> 类家心平左脸大瞩目，the one and the two</span></li><span>  </span><li><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4800">01:20:00</a></span></strong><span> 要问谁是J-POP最阳光的阳光三娃爸（之一</span></li><span>  </span><li><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="5400">01:30:00</a> </span></strong><span>心中有幸福包裹感的音乐小撇步，错过的音乐场景</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><p><span>🎵 Song List：</span></p><span></span><p><span>Firecracker (1978)- Yellow Magic Orchestra</span></p><span></span><p><span>花に水 - 细野晴臣</span></p><span></span><p><span>Asadoya Yunta（2021） - </span><a href="https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCoycwm1Mc9FMtzi0hynKlNA" data-url="https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCoycwm1Mc9FMtzi0hynKlNA"><span>折坂悠太</span></a></p><span></span><p><span>Asatoya Yunta (2019 Remastering) - 细野晴臣1978 安里屋ユンタ / ASATOYA YUNTA (from “PARAISO”)</span></p><span></span><p><span>本多工務店のテーマ - 渋さ知らズ</span></p><span></span><p><span>📨 小听众来信：weibo </span><a href="https://weibo.com/n/%E9%87%8E%E9%83%8E%E6%9C%AA%E6%9D%A5" data-url="https://weibo.com/n/%E9%87%8E%E9%83%8E%E6%9C%AA%E6%9D%A5"><span>@野郎未来</span></a></p>]]></description>
