  <item>
    <title>12 一二，乌龙茶和人文的鸟瞰（上）</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/66dd69ceee04007d88f9ad01</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">66dd69ceee04007d88f9ad01</guid>
    <pubDate>Sun, 08 Sep 2024 09:09:32 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>“像在水底一样美丽的光”是我现在想到三得利乌龙茶广告的感受。SUN-AD的创意工作者们用二十余载创造了一道人文的弧光。被葛西薰形容为“人类故乡一般的存在”的中国大地上，哪些静流之情感被茶之味传达。从茶大人到茶之子到乌龙歌集，是人文之鸟瞰，也是流动在身体里的未来。世界和平，世界男女。爱的生动，颜的意志。这些都被藏在「一二，乌龙茶」的诉说里，成为人类乡愁的韵脚。</span><br><span>请你望向深处。</span><br><span>听我娓娓道来。</span><br><span>本期也在做新的实验，自然地插入声音碎片希望让事物的诉说有种散点透视的感觉。内容较多，分上下期放送。</span><br><span> </span><br><span>🕙 时间轴：</span><br><span>- <a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="660">11:00</a> 一个广告，投石入湖；一个海报：「广岛的呼唤」隽永的真实</span><br><span>- <a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1200">20:00</a> 当我面对上田义彦席地而坐，再探乌龙茶</span><br><span>- <a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1620">27:00</a> 古画里的「茶大人」遇到葛西熏</span><br><span>- <a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2700">45:00</a> 桂林山峦中湿润的羽毛球和“永远要憧憬，永远要向往”</span><br><span>- <a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3300">55:00</a> 在「椿之庭」中慢慢相爱</span><br><span>- <a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3900">01:05:00</a> 歌谣篇的创作和「乌龙歌集」的延展</span><br><span>- <a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4560">01:16:00</a> 公园里的「茶之子」毕业礼</span><br><span>- <a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="5220">01:27:00</a> 「乌龙航空」</span><br><span>- <a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="5700">01:35:00</a> 「零的热量」和乐基儿的上海Boogie Woogie</span><br><span>- <a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="6300">01:45:00</a> 请你望向深处，浅叶克己之后的创造，人类故乡，清水靖晃</span><br><span> </span><br><span>🎵 Song List：</span><br><span>楽園ベイベー —— RIP SLYME</span><br><span>CHAI～SUNTORY OOLONG TEA CM SONG COLLECTIONS～</span><br><span>Ricoh 1 —— 清水靖晃</span><br><span>蛍火 —— PUNPEE / BIM</span><br><span> </span><br><span>📨 小听众来信：weibo @野郎未来</span><br><span> </span><br><span>【🔗 相关链接】</span><br><span>· サントリー烏龍茶のCMと「中国」</span><a href="https://www.qingxianghualou.com/blogs/bochibochi/suntory-cm-china" data-url="https://www.qingxianghualou.com/blogs/bochibochi/suntory-cm-china"><span>www.qingxianghualou.com</span></a><br><span>· ◎ 第7回　 サントリーウーロン茶　歴代CM集 </span><a href="https://web.archive.org/web/20170429085326/http://www.sun-ad.co.jp/work/feature/vol7/" data-url="https://web.archive.org/web/20170429085326/http://www.sun-ad.co.jp/work/feature/vol7/"><span>web.archive.org</span></a><br><span>· 上田义彦| 作为心象风景的写真 </span><a href="https://www.qingxianghualou.com/blogs/bochibochi/suntory-cm-china" data-url="https://www.qingxianghualou.com/blogs/bochibochi/suntory-cm-china"><span>www.qingxianghualou.com</span></a></p>]]></description>
